// America/New_York 2500-11-07T01:30:00 -> 2500-11-07T01:30:00-04:00 EDT dst true unix 16752029400
// footer gap 2038-03-14T01:30:00-05:00 2038-03-14T03:30:00-04:00
// lmt -04:56:02 LMT
// Australia/Lord_Howe 2024-01-15T12:00:00 -> 2024-01-15T12:00:00+11:00 +11 dst true unix 1705280400
